            "value": "Your everyday partner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Curieux de tout. Précis sur l’essentiel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Curious about everything. Precise about what matters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Des idées aux choses qui existent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From ideas to things that exist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "J’aimerais une journée un peu plus légère.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I’d like a slightly lighter day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On fait de la place.\n\nChoisis **une seule chose** qui rendrait ta journée satisfaisante. Le reste peut attendre.\n\nQu’est-ce qui compte le plus pour toi aujourd’hui ?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let’s make some room.\n\nPick **one thing** that would make the day feel enough. The rest can wait.\n\nWhat matters most to you today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
